        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwarere pa Yesu Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a bol ma nywolirok pa Yesu Kristo, nyakwar Daudi aka nyakwar Abraham: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham onywolo Isaka, Isaka onywolo Yakobo, Yakobo onywolo Yuda gi wutmin go; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda to nywolo Perez gi Zera i yok jo Tamar, Perez onywolo Heziron, Heziron onywolo Ram; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram onywolo Aminadab, Aminadab onywolo Nason, Nason onywolo Salimon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salimon gi cege Rahab to jonywolo Bowaz, Bowaz gi cege Ruth to jonywolo Obed, Obed onywolo Yese; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 24:14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 36:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yese onywolo Daudi Kere. Daudi onywolo Solomon ma min oyido obedo cipa Uriya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon onywolo Rehobowam, Rehobowam onywolo Abija, Abija onywolo Asa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa onywolo Yehosafat, Yehosafat onywolo Yoram; Yoram onywolo Uziya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya onywolo Yotham, Yotham onywolo Ahaz, Ahaz onywolo Hezekia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia onywolo Manase; Manase onywolo Amos, Amos onywolo Yosia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia to nywolo Yekonia gi wutmin go, gikenyo to itero jo paka ŋecin yu Babilon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo otiek tero jo yu Babilon, Yekonia onywolo Salutiel, Salutiel to nywolo Zerubabel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zerubabel to nywolo Abiud, Abiud to nywolo Eliakim, Eliakim to nywolo Azor; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azor to nywolo Zadok; Zadok to nywolo Akim, Akim to nywolo Eliyudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliyudi to nywolo Eliazar; Eliazar to nywolo Mathan, Mathan to nywolo Yakobo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo onywolo Yozefu, m'obedo cwor Maria, m'onywolo Yesu m'ilwoŋo ni Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, wok kwoŋ Abraham tundo kwoŋ Daudi, obedo luse ji apar g'aŋwen; odoko wok kwoŋ Daudi, tundo munyo oter jo yu Babilon, obedo luse ji apar g'aŋwen; kendo wok munyo oter jo yu Babilon tundo kwoŋ Kristo, bende obedo luse ji apar g'aŋwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa Yesu Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me apaka nywolirok pa Yesu Kristo obedo: Munyo Yozefu fodi oyido nyaka jocikere nywomirok kodi Maria min Yesu, mafodi k'orwako go i ot, to nenere ni go oyido otieko gamo iye i meni pa Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yozefu cwore, rupiri oyido obedo dhano m'otire aka k'omito miyo go wickwot, oyido paro weyo go nyaliŋliŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, munyo fodi go paro ameno, malaika pa Rwoth to bino rigo i lek, to waco rigo ni, “Yozefu wod pa Daudi, Ikir'ilwor rwako Maria bedo dhako perin, rupiri go yac gi meni pa Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bino nywolo nyathi majayac, aka ibino cwoko nyinge ni Yesu; rupiri go ama bino botho ji pere kwoŋ reco pajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gino je otimere, ŋey gima jatuci wac Were oluwo wotundi i kare ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyako mambula bino gamo iye, to nywolo nyathi majayac, m'ibino cwoko nyinge ni Manwer.” Dwoŋ mere ni, “Were nigi wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu munyo ocew, to timo paka malaika pa Were owaco rigo, to tero Maria bedo cege; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka k'obedo gine tundo munyo ocowo nywolo nyathi no to cwoko nyinge ni Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
